{"book":"kinney","chapter":"react-typescript","chapterTitle":"React مع TypeScript","slug":"type-level-testing-in-practice","title":"اختبار الأنواع (Type-Level Testing) في الممارسة","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"tsd-أو-expecttypeof","text":"tsd أو expectTypeOf"},{"depth":2,"id":"التكامل-المستمر-ci-وتغطية-الأنواع","text":"التكامل المستمر (CI) وتغطية الأنواع"},{"depth":2,"id":"اختبار-المكونات-متعددة-الأشكال-polymorphic","text":"اختبار المكوّنات متعدّدة الأشكال (Polymorphic)"},{"depth":2,"id":"الحفاظ-على-خصائص-مكونات-higher-order-hoc","text":"الحفاظ على خصائص مكوّنات higher-order (HOC)"},{"depth":2,"id":"إعداد-tsd-بديل","text":"إعداد tsd (بديل)"},{"depth":2,"id":"حماية-الواجهات-البرمجية-العامة-public-apis-في-المكتبات","text":"حماية الواجهات البرمجية العامة (Public APIs) في المكتبات"},{"depth":2,"id":"لقطات-snapshots-لأنواع-مكونات-public","text":"لقطات (Snapshots) لأنواع مكوّنات public"}],"html":"<p>يمكن للأنواع أن تتدحرج (regress) بصمت. أضف اختبارات على مستوى الأنواع (type-level tests) للكشف عن الأعطال عند إعادة تشكيل الأنواع العامة (generics)، والتحميلات الزائدة (overloads)، والواجهات البرمجية العامة (public APIs).</p>\n<h2 id=\"tsd-أو-expecttypeof\"><code>tsd</code> أو <code>expectTypeOf</code></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// vitest + expectTypeOf</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { expectTypeOf, describe, it } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vitest&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Foo</span>&lt;T&gt; = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: T };\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">describe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Foo&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">it</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;preserves generic&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">x</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Foo</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>&gt; = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">42</span> };\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expectTypeOf</span>(x.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>).<span class=\"hljs-property\">toEqualTypeOf</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>&gt;();\n  });\n});\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"التكامل-المستمر-ci-وتغطية-الأنواع\">التكامل المستمر (CI) وتغطية الأنواع</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>شغّل اختبارات الأنواع في CI تمامًا كما تفعل مع اختبارات الوحدة.</li>\n<li>تتبّع ميزانيات «تغطية الأنواع»: امنع <code>any</code>، وفرض <code>noUncheckedIndexedAccess</code>.</li>\n<li>اجعل إصدارات مكتبات المكوّنات مشروطة باجتياز تحقّقات الأنواع.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"اختبار-المكونات-متعددة-الأشكال-polymorphic\">اختبار المكوّنات متعدّدة الأشكال (Polymorphic)</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { expectTypeOf, it } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vitest&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Polymorphic Button with `as` prop</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">declare</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Button</span>&lt;C <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">ElementType</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;button&#x27;</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-attr\">props</span>: {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span>?: C;\n} &amp; <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">ComponentPropsWithoutRef</span>&lt;C&gt;): <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">ReactNode</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">it</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;infers correct props for anchor&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> el = <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;a&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expectTypeOf</span>(el.<span class=\"hljs-property\">props</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">href</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBeString</span>(); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// href must exist on anchor</span>\n});\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الحفاظ-على-خصائص-مكونات-higher-order-hoc\">الحفاظ على خصائص مكوّنات higher-order (HOC)</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> withLogging&lt;P&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Comp</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">ComponentType</span>&lt;P&gt;) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">props</span>: P</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Comp</span> {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...props</span>} /&gt;</span></span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InputProps</span> = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onChange</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">v</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span></span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span> };\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Input</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">FC</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InputProps</span>&gt; = <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">LoggedInput</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">withLogging</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Input</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ensure HOC preserves prop types</span>\nexpectTypeOf&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">LoggedInput</span>&gt;[<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>]&gt;().<span class=\"hljs-property\">toEqualTypeOf</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InputProps</span>&gt;();\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"إعداد-tsd-بديل\">إعداد <code>tsd</code> (بديل)</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// package.json</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;scripts&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;test:types&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;tsd&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// tsd.config.json</span>\n{\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;entry&quot;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;./types/**/*.test-d.ts&quot;</span>\n}\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// types/button.test-d.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { expectType } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;tsd&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Button</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;../dist&#x27;</span>;\n\nexpectType&lt;<span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">JSX</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">Element</span>&gt;(<span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Button</span> /&gt;</span></span>);\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"حماية-الواجهات-البرمجية-العامة-public-apis-في-المكتبات\">حماية الواجهات البرمجية العامة (Public APIs) في المكتبات</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>صدّر الأنواع (<code>export type { ButtonProps }</code>) وتحقّق منها في <code>test:types</code>.</li>\n<li>ثبّت overloads والقيم الافتراضية (defaults) للـ generics بتحقّقات موجّهة.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"لقطات-snapshots-لأنواع-مكونات-public\">لقطات (Snapshots) لأنواع مكوّنات public</h2>\n<p>ثبّت واجهتك البرمجية public بأنواع type snapshots باستخدام <code>tsd</code> أو <code>expectTypeOf</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// tsd: Button and TextField public types</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentProps</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { expectType } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;tsd&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Button</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;../dist&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TextField</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;../dist&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Button supports as=&quot;a&quot; | &quot;button&quot; and mirrors intrinsic attrs</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonProps</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Button</span>&gt;;\nexpectType&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonProps</span>&gt;({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;button&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onClick</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {} });\nexpectType&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonProps</span>&gt;({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/home&#x27;</span> });\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// @ts-expect-error - anchors need href</span>\nexpectType&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonProps</span>&gt;({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span> });\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// TextField narrows onChange to the correct event type</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TextFieldProps</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TextField</span>&gt;;\nexpectType&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TextFieldProps</span>&gt;({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">label</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Name&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onChange</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">e</span>) =&gt;</span> e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">target</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> });\nexpectType&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TextFieldProps</span>&gt;({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;textarea&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">label</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Bio&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">defaultValue</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onChange</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">e</span>) =&gt;</span> e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">target</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>,\n});\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// @ts-expect-error - wrong event type for textarea</span>\nexpectType&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TextFieldProps</span>&gt;({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;textarea&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">label</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Bio&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onChange</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">e</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ChangeEvent</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HTMLInputElement</span>&gt;</span>) =&gt;</span> {},\n});\n</code></pre>\n"}